#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:47
msgid "Caching Strategies"
msgstr ""

#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:48
msgid "All network requests are cached by Instantify, so that your website can serve content from the browser cache if available and display requested content as fast as possible. Here you are able to manually change the caching strategy for some request types. Available caching strategies (hover for description):"
msgstr ""

#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:49
msgid "This strategy will use a cached response for a request if it is available and update the cache in the background with a response form the network. (If it’s not cached it will wait for the network response and use that). This is a fairly safe strategy as it means users are regularly updating their cache. The downside of this strategy is that it’s always requesting an asset from the network, using up the user’s bandwidth."
msgstr ""

#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:49
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:59
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:71
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:83
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:95
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:107
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:119
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:131
msgid "Stale While Revalidate"
msgstr ""

#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:50
msgid "This will try and get a request from the network first. If it receives a response, it’ll pass that to the browser and also save it to a cache. If the network request fails, the last cached response will be used."
msgstr ""

#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:50
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:60
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:72
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:84
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:96
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:108
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:120
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:132
msgid "Network First"
msgstr ""

#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:51
msgid "This strategy will check the cache for a response first and use that if one is available. If the request isn’t in the cache, the network will be used and any valid response will be added to the cache before being passed to the browser."
msgstr ""

#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:51
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:61
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:73
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:85
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:97
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:109
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:121
#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:133
msgid "Cache First"
msgstr ""

#: pwa/admin/templates/subpage-offlineusage.php:52
msgid "This strategy won't cache anything. The network will be used and the response will be passed directly to the browser (That's how the browser would handle the request without the Instantify)."
msgstr ""

